{"seq":3,"slug":"in-game-calendars","title":"游戏内日历","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-day-night/foundations/in-game-calendars","wordCount":1425,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"游戏内日历\">游戏内日历</h1><p>《星露谷物语》把一年切成春夏秋冬四季、每季 28 天，于是「秋天 16 号是星期几、该种什么作物、谁的生日快到了」成了玩家心里随时能盘算的坐标系。一串单调递增的游戏分钟数对人类是没有意义的，必须向上折叠成日、月、季、年这样可读的层级——这正是日历要做的事：在 <a href=\"game-time-abstraction\">游戏时间抽象</a> 给出的扁平时钟之上，铺一层世界共识的「今天是几月几号」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>游戏内日历是一组把绝对游戏分钟数解码成多级字段的换算规则。它本质上是定义一套进制：多少分钟进一小时、多少小时进一天、多少天进一季、多少季进一年。与现实历法不同，游戏日历几乎总是被简化——多数游戏用「每季固定 N 天」而非现实里参差的 28/30/31 天，因为整齐的进位让玩法、UI 和存档都更简单。</p>\n<p>下图展示分钟数自底向上的逐级进位，以及季节如何反过来回授给昼夜与生态：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[totalGameMinutes 绝对分钟] --&gt; B[当日分钟 mod 一天]&#10;    B --&gt; C[小时 / 分钟 字段]&#10;    A --&gt; D[天数 div 一天]&#10;    D --&gt; E[星期 / 月 / 季]&#10;    E --&gt; F[年]&#10;    E --&gt; G[回授: 季节调制日照时长]&#10;    E --&gt; H[回授: 季节调制作物与生物]\">flowchart TD\n    A[totalGameMinutes 绝对分钟] --&gt; B[当日分钟 mod 一天]\n    B --&gt; C[小时 / 分钟 字段]\n    A --&gt; D[天数 div 一天]\n    D --&gt; E[星期 / 月 / 季]\n    E --&gt; F[年]\n    E --&gt; G[回授: 季节调制日照时长]\n    E --&gt; H[回授: 季节调制作物与生物]</pre><p>不同游戏对「一天多长」和历法结构的选择差异巨大，下表对比几个代表，帮助你定位自己项目的取值区间：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>游戏</th>\n<th>现实时长/游戏天</th>\n<th>历法结构</th>\n<th>现实秒/游戏分钟</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>星露谷物语</td>\n<td>约 14 分钟（不暂停）</td>\n<td>4 季 × 28 天</td>\n<td>0.7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动物森友会</td>\n<td>24 小时（与现实同步）</td>\n<td>与现实历法一致</td>\n<td>60</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>我的世界</td>\n<td>20 分钟</td>\n<td>无季节、纯昼夜</td>\n<td>0.83</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上古卷轴5</td>\n<td>约 1.2 小时（默认 20 倍）</td>\n<td>12 月仿现实</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型生活模拟</td>\n<td>8–20 分钟</td>\n<td>自定义 N 天/月</td>\n<td>0.5–1.5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>数据来源：星露谷 0.7 现实秒/游戏分钟、每天 6:00–次日 2:00 共 20 小时见 Stardew Valley Wiki「Day Cycle」；我的世界一天 20 分钟为其公开设定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多级换算-从分钟到年\">多级换算：从分钟到年</h2><p>日历的解码是一连串带余除法。设一天有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟、一周有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 天、一月（季）有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 天、一年有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 月，给定绝对分钟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>minuteOfDay</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>D</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>dayIndex</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mi>D</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{minuteOfDay} = T \\bmod D, \\qquad \\text{dayIndex} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{T}{D} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">minuteOfDay</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dayIndex</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>dayOfWeek</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>dayIndex</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>W</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>monthIndex</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mtext>dayIndex</mtext><mi>K</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>year</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mtext>monthIndex</mtext><mi>S</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dayOfWeek} = \\text{dayIndex} \\bmod W, \\quad \\text{monthIndex} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{\\text{dayIndex}}{K} \\right\\rfloor, \\quad \\text{year} = \\left\\lfloor \\frac{\\text{monthIndex}}{S} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dayOfWeek</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dayIndex</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">monthIndex</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dayIndex</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">year</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">monthIndex</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把它写成一个纯函数式的解码器，输入一个 long、输出一个结构体，便于存档与显示共用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public readonly struct GameDate {&#10;    public int Year, Season, DayOfSeason, Hour, Minute, DayOfWeek;&#10;    const int MinPerDay = 1440, DaysPerSeason = 28, SeasonsPerYear = 4, DaysPerWeek = 7;&#10;&#10;    public static GameDate Decode(long totalMinutes) {&#10;        long dayIndex = totalMinutes / MinPerDay;&#10;        int minOfDay = (int)(totalMinutes % MinPerDay);&#10;        return new GameDate {&#10;            Year        = (int)(dayIndex / (DaysPerSeason * SeasonsPerYear)),&#10;            Season      = (int)(dayIndex / DaysPerSeason % SeasonsPerYear),&#10;            DayOfSeason = (int)(dayIndex % DaysPerSeason),&#10;            DayOfWeek   = (int)(dayIndex % DaysPerWeek),&#10;            Hour        = minOfDay / 60,&#10;            Minute      = minOfDay % 60,&#10;        };&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public readonly struct GameDate {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public int Year, Season, DayOfSeason, Hour, Minute, DayOfWeek;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const int MinPerDay = 1440, DaysPerSeason = 28, SeasonsPerYear = 4, DaysPerWeek = 7;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static GameDate Decode(long totalMinutes) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        long dayIndex = totalMinutes / MinPerDay;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int minOfDay = (int)(totalMinutes % MinPerDay);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return new GameDate {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Year        = (int)(dayIndex / (DaysPerSeason * SeasonsPerYear)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Season      = (int)(dayIndex / DaysPerSeason % SeasonsPerYear),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            DayOfSeason = (int)(dayIndex % DaysPerSeason),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            DayOfWeek   = (int)(dayIndex % DaysPerWeek),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Hour        = minOfDay / 60,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Minute      = minOfDay % 60,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把解码做成纯函数有两个好处：UI 显示和存档恢复都调同一个，不会出现「显示的日期和存的日期对不上」；同时它无副作用、可单测，给它一个分钟数断言一个日期即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一天的边界-何时不是午夜\">一天的边界：何时不是午夜</h2><p>现实里一天从午夜 0:00 开始，但很多游戏的「一天」并不从午夜切。星露谷的一天是 6:00 到次日 2:00——玩家睡觉才换日，而非午夜自动跳。这带来一个设计抉择：<strong>逻辑日界</strong>（什么时候 dayIndex 加一、刷新商店与作物）可以不等于<strong>自然午夜</strong>（太阳走到最低点）。</p>\n<p>把这两个边界解耦很关键。昼夜渲染的相位仍以真实的午夜到午夜计算（太阳轨迹是物理的），而玩法的「新的一天」可以挂在玩家就寝或某个固定钟点。实现上，相位用 <code>minuteOfDay / MinPerDay</code>，而「刷新事件」单独监听 <code>dayIndex</code> 的变化或一个专门的「睡觉」动作。混淆二者，会出现「时间到了午夜，但作物没刷新、商店没开门」的违和。逻辑日界触发的刷新如何挂到事件系统，见 <a href=\"../systems/time-driven-events\">时间驱动事件</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"季节-日历里的慢变量\">季节：日历里的慢变量</h2><p>季节是日历中变化最慢、却影响最广的字段。它不只是换个天空色，而是一个被无数系统订阅的全局慢变量：调制日照时长（冬天日短夜长）、调制作物可否生长、调制生物刷新表、调制天气触发概率。把季节做成日历的一个派生字段而非独立状态，能保证它始终与时钟同步、随存档自动恢复。</p>\n<p>季节驱动日照时长是昼夜系统与日历的第一个交汇点：同一个相位 0.25（清晨）在夏季可能太阳已高悬，在冬季却仍灰蒙蒙。实现上，让日出日落的相位阈值成为季节的函数，再喂给太阳位置计算。季节如何进一步联动生态与天气的完整机制，见 <a href=\"../systems/seasons-weather-link\">季节与生态联动</a>；季节改变日照时长后太阳轨迹的调整见 <a href=\"../day-night/sun-moon-position\">日月轨迹</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>日历是在扁平游戏分钟之上铺的一套自定义进制，把分钟解码成时、日、周、季、年等可读字段。</li>\n<li>游戏历法通常简化为「每季固定 N 天」，整齐进位让玩法、UI、存档都更简单。</li>\n<li>把解码写成无副作用的纯函数，UI 显示与存档恢复共用同一份，杜绝日期不一致。</li>\n<li>解耦「逻辑日界」（何时刷新世界）与「自然午夜」（太阳最低点），二者可不重合。</li>\n<li>季节是日历里最慢、影响最广的字段，应做成派生字段，被日照、作物、生物、天气共同订阅。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"game-time-abstraction\">游戏时间抽象</a> —— 日历解码的输入时钟；<a href=\"../systems/seasons-weather-link\">季节与生态联动</a> —— 季节字段如何牵动生态；<a href=\"../systems/time-driven-events\">时间驱动事件</a> —— 逻辑日界如何触发刷新。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：日历驱动的活动/节庆作为玩法节奏的一部分见 <a href=\"../../game-design/level-design/difficulty-curve\">难度曲线</a>；季节性内容的运营投放见 <a href=\"../../game-monetization-liveops/\">游戏运营 LiveOps</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"游戏内日历","id":"游戏内日历"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"多级换算：从分钟到年","id":"多级换算-从分钟到年"},{"level":2,"text":"一天的边界：何时不是午夜","id":"一天的边界-何时不是午夜"},{"level":2,"text":"季节：日历里的慢变量","id":"季节-日历里的慢变量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"时间缩放与暂停","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-day-night/foundations/time-scaling-pausing"},"next":{"title":"日月轨迹","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-day-night/day-night/sun-moon-position"}}